{{sendResponse nil (complexMessage "embed" (cembed "title" (print "Search results in <#" $ch.ID ">: " $n) "description" $c) "menus" (cslice (sdict "type" "text" "placeholder" "Filter by tags" "custom_id" "forumToolsFilter1" "options" $d "min_values" 0 "max_values" (len $d)) (sdict "type" "text" "placeholder" "Filter out tags" "custom_id" "forumToolsFilter2" "options" $d "max_values" (len $d))))}}
